<!--
A BrowseName is a QualifiedName: its namespace is part of it. A child is the member a declaration of its
parent's type declares only when name AND namespace agree; a placeholder's instances may have any namespace.
AlphaType declares the mandatory Level (an array) and Link (whose declaration adds the mandatory Status) and the
optional placeholder <Part> of PartType. In both cases the placeholder instance PartA is in namespace 0 and
is accepted.
The instance's Link has Status of namespace 0, so the Status that Link's declaration adds is missing; the
instance's Level is AlphaType's Level and is an array.
-->
